message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "doubleml-pipeline: automated causal inference with Double Machine Learning and AutoML"
authors:
  - name: "Google LLC"
version: 0.2.2
date-released: 2026-07-05
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/google/doubleml-pipeline"
url: "https://github.com/google/doubleml-pipeline"
keywords:
  - causal inference
  - double machine learning
  - marketing mix modeling
  - uplift
  - econometrics
abstract: >-
  A Python library that estimates the incremental impact and ROI of marketing
  interventions (promotions, discounts, prices, media spend) from observational
  panel data with Double Machine Learning and FLAML AutoML, including
  saturation-aware treatment models, budget optimization and an agentic AI
  layer for interpreting the estimates.
